      ],
      "title": "Data Type and Sample Size",
      "gist": "Applying PID in practice requires matching a redundancy measure to whether data are discrete or continuous, and gathering enough samples to reliably estimate joint probabilities, since undersampling severely distorts entropy estimates."
    },
