      "title": "6.2. Interpreting PID Results as Neural Information Processing",
      "gist": "PID reveals statistical dependencies between neurons but does not by itself explain the biological mechanisms, such as neurotransmitter systems or architecture, that make a neuron synergy-dominated or redundancy-dominated.",
